{
  "id": "crystal",
  "name": "Crystal",
  "short": "Crystal",
  "summary": "Glass shards tumbling as a cluster, re-posed on beats, scattered over the bar.",
  "credit": "After the Crystal in Felix Turner's Uberviz (https://uberviz.io). No code used; written new with Claude Code.",
  "hint": "Shards tumbling as a cluster: loudness swells it, each beat eases one shard into a new pose, scatter flings them apart and back over the bar. Solid shards cover each other like cut stone; glass ones add up.",
  "items": 84,
  "triangles": 256,
